 "remarks": "Welcome to Hampshire House! An excellent opportunity for affordable homeownership in Stamford. Why rent when you can own? This freshly painted one-bedroom, one-bath co-op features a spacious living room that flows seamlessly into the dining area, hardwood floors throughout. Enjoy the added privacy of a top-floor location with no neighbors above. One of the standout features is the all-inclusive monthly co-op fee, which includes heat, hot water, and property taxes, making budgeting for homeownership more convenient. Unit comes with an added storage unit. The grounds are well maintained with benches, areas for sitting, and a playscape on the property. Coin-Op Laundry located in the building next door. Location is truly ideally situated near shopping, dining, transportation, and all that Stamford has to offer, this is a wonderful opportunity for first-time buyers, downsizers, or anyone looking to build equity rather than rent. No dogs, allows one cat.",
